  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;"><strong>Abstract Submission:</strong> The submitted abstract should be no more than 300 words, not including the title and 3-5 keywords. Please submit abstracts by <span data-field="abstract_deadline">{{ abstract_deadline }}</span> to <span data-field="submission_email">{{ submission_email }}</span> and you will be notified of selection by <span data-field="notification_date">{{ notification_date }}</span>.</p>
  <ol style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>Maximum poster size is 42" x 64" as the surface area is 4 foot wide and 8 foot tall</li>
    <li>Please have the poster set up on Saturday morning before 8 AM</li>
    <li>Please have it taken down by 12:00 PM on Sunday, otherwise it will be discarded at the close of the meeting.</li>
  </ol>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;">Posters will not be judged, but rather this will be a time of dialogue among conference participants.</p>

